  "description": "Cantina, the ultimate in simplicity and style. Redesigned SuperCruise Pedal-Forward frame available in five fresh flavors, and outfitted with a super comfy oversized Del Sol cruiser springer saddle and custom Del Sol cruiser bars that are always within reach. Alloy rims and stainless steel spokes are lightweight and rust free. Cantina, is your \"all-coasts\" (and all points in-between) solution for the slow lane.\nHi-ten steel SuperCruise Pedal-Forward frame featuring longer, more laid-back geometry for the perfect cruise\nSimple one-speed, coaster brake drivetrain for ease of use\nCustom Del Sol Cruiser bars for the most comfortable hand position\nNew Del Sol elastomer-sprung cruiser saddle\nLightweight & rust-free alloy rims\nSmooth riding 26\" x 2.125\" cruiser tires",
